gory/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-05T15:26:11-07:00","id":982392,"title":"","content":"I can think of two books I'd like to see.<br /> <br /> One I would call &quot;Second Children&quot;, after the name for 'demons' from the original Singe prophecy. In my never ending quest to unite the various demonic elements of the WOD, it would cover &quot;cousins&quot; to Demonkind that for one reason or another are hunted by the God-Machine or simply work against It for their own reasons. Start with Furies and Second Children (again, see the prophecy) and expand into cryptids and move into stranger things like corrupted ghosts or spirits (yeah, I'm sayng retool the &quot;lesser&quot; demons from Inferno into the Descent setting basically). Maybe also include facilities the Machine has abandoned and places on the Earth it simply does not go for one reason or another (where angels fear to tread, as it were). Maybe expand glitches into scarier options. Introduce a few &quot;ERRORS&quot; in reality to round everything out. Also, more rules for cults.<br /> <br /> And since I'm thinking of Singe, how about a &quot;Holy Book&quot; in the style of the pain prophet, half scripture half conspiracy theory, perhaps presented as an in game object of collected prophecies and portents on the desk of the Deva Corporation.<br /> <br /> Speaking of which....how about a Deva Corp examination, either as its own book of subsidaries like Pentex or a chapter in a bigger antagonists book?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2244-nothri","name":"nothri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T04:41:46-08:00","id":1034523,"title":"","content":"Another book I would love to see is a <br /> <br /> Glimpses Of The Unknown book for demon decent and beast","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T11:45:01-08:00","id":1034750,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1540_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1540\" data-vbnamecard=\"1540\">Basic</a> <br /> Interesting, give me your best elevator pitch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-19T15:51:41-08:00","id":1034908,"title":"","content":"Ok<br /> <br /> &quot;there are more things in heaven and hell than are dreamt of in your philosophy&quot; - Hamlet<br /> <br /> <br /> The world of darkness is full of shadows but some are deeper than other. Once demons fall they begin there decent but sometimes as they descend into the shadows of the world they reach unknown depths. Thing stranger than just angels and infrastructures. This book would cover some strange possible god-machine beings from space, strange splinter realities that have no basis for existing. Then the book could cover strange demonic activity. Being demons are still evolving and changing the question is what are they changing into, are they changing into another god-machine or something worse? Whole cites were the population have been replace by some kind of sub angel. Signals that seem to come just beyond time and project 47<br /> <br /> You could just make this a night horrors book with some strange stuff in it<br /> <br /> So I had a few minutes and in photo shop I made a possible cover for the book.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/3g9Em2V.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 01-19-2017, 06:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/154