"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-21T09:47:26-08:00","id":1035730,"title":"","content":"Thanks guys. I'm happy you like it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> I thought it would be fun to make a possible first fiction for the book if it existed <br /> <br /> The Black Obelisk<br /> <br /> I've lived in this city since my creation and even after my fall. In that time, I've made deals with dead men who live life fuller then those still alive, I've stole from sorcerers to gain arcane knowledge, I made friends of devils and enemies of angels. All of this has shown me such strange wonders but I can't help but stare out my window every night into the darkness of the city. Out my window some distance away stands a black Obelisk. Its blackness just darker than the night sky. I feel all my hairs stand on end as I stare at it and it feels like its somehow staring back at me. I've posted on all the boards and asked others even close friends of mine but known anything about it or can even see it. Every night it feels like it\u2019s getting bigger or its getting closer I can't tell which. Every night at 4 am I awake up with an urge to do something in my kitchen just to see if it\u2019s still there and every night it is. Its blackness blots out the stars in the sky. I will make final preparations to investigate this Obelisk. Even thinking about it give me goosebumps like a cold chill has entered my heated home. <br /> <br /> 4th to last entry of Turner Fordmen Diary. <br /> 1-1, 11-2, 5-4, 8-7, 26-2,11-5, 8-2, 1-3, 8-4, 2-5, 1-1, 90-1, 36-1, 4-1, 4-2, 2-2, 4-4, 8-2, 26-2, 8-8<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-24T17:11:25-08:00","id":1037493,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/932595-will-there-be-anymore-books?p=1034908#post1034908\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;there are more things in heaven and hell than are dreamt of in your philosophy&amp;quot; - Hamlet<br /> <br /> <br /> The world of darkness is full of shadows but some are deeper than other. Once demons fall they begin there decent but sometimes as they descend into the shadows of the world they reach unknown depths. Thing stranger than just angels and infrastructures. This book would cover some strange possible god-machine beings from space, strange splinter realities that have no basis for existing. Then the book could cover strange demonic activity. Being demons are still evolving and changing the question is what are they changing into, are they changing into another god-machine or something worse? Whole cites were the population have been replace by some kind of sub angel. Signals that seem to come just beyond time and project 47<br /> <br /> You could just make this a night horrors book with some strange stuff in it<br /> <br /> So I had a few minutes and in photo shop I made a possible cover for the book.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/3g9Em2V.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div> That's an awesome cover.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-24T17:25:14-08:00","id":1037502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/932595-will-there-be-anymore-books?p=1035186#post1035186\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Agreed. I recognize some of the sources images, so those probably couldn't be used as is (without some agreements/licensing), but the collage/work itself is very good.</div> </div> </div> </div>The only one I recognize (I think) is the Phyrexian right above the logo. Honestly though, I couldn't think of a better source for Demons and the God-Machine than Scars of Mirrodin anyhow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-24T20:27:42-08:00","id":1037626,"title":"","content":"+1 from me for a Night Horrors supplement please.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1630-jacob","name":"Jacob","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1630_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"681"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-27T09:15:55-08:00","id":1038935,"title":"","content":"I can think of at least one more book that will deal with Demon, the Crossover Chronicles.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T04:08:55-08:00","id":1057526,"title":"","content":"I think an interested possible enemy for the night horrors books would be what I call the reasserted. Its a human begin who's concessions reasserts itself when an angel possess them, Melding the two like when a spirit claims someone. Now its a mutated human angel hybrid with the powers of an angel and irrationality of a human. I think they would be short lived because I don't believe the god-machine would tolerate such corruption.<br /> <br /> It gets more interesting when it happens to a demon who possess a human.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T06:03:33-08:00","id":1057559,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/932595-will-there-be-anymore-books?p=1057526#post1057526\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think an interested possible enemy for the night horrors books would be what I call the reasserted. Its a human begin who's concessions reasserts itself when an angel possess them, Melding the two like when a spirit claims someone. Now its a mutated human angel hybrid with the powers of an angel and irrationality of a human. I think they would be short lived because I don't believe the god-machine would tolerate such corruption.</div> </div> </div> </div>What would be the difference between that and an angel claimed who already exist as hybrids of angels and humans?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T06:15:12-08:00","id":1057563,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/932595-will-there-be-anymore-books?p=1057559#post1057559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What would be the difference between that and an angel claimed who already exist as hybrids of angels and humans?</div> </div> </div> </div>Also I'm thinking of calling them <span style=\"color:#263238\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">The resubstantiated (I don't know I just like the name of it)</span></span><br /> <br /> Well see a claimed is a fusion of s spirit and a mortal. They become something completely new. Angels have a few ways of existing in the world but I will just put 3 up. (Also I just came up with the idea like a few hours ago so I'm still tweaking things)<br /> <span style=\"color:#263238\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">1. They possess a human<br /> 2. They are Given a Body<br /> 3. They just exist with out a corporeal body and materialize </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#263238\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> The first one is were I got the idea. So when an angel possess a human what if something went wrong and rather then possession is became a claiming. If that happened the angel and human would fuse and make something so beautiful.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#263238\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> I would leave them the default open connection to pull power right from the god-machine to do things still. So I thought its an interesting idea. If you have suggestions pleas tell me.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#263238\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> no if that was not enough</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#263238\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"> The resubstantiated I just described are only normal humans it get funky when it happens to an offspring of a demon because now. You have a being with all the powers of an angel and a demon and nothing to lose muahahahahahahahahahahahahhaa</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T06:21:46-08:00","id":1057566,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/932595-will-there-be-anymore-books?p=1057563#post1057563\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well see a claimed is a fusion of s spirit and a mortal. They become something completely new.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not according the ephemeral entity rules. All three of the ephemeral entities can end up fusing themselves with mortals resulting in claimed. There are ghost-claimed, spirit-claimed, and angel-claimed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T06:43:15-08:00","id":1057572,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/932595-will-there-be-anymore-books?p=1057566#post1057566\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not according the ephemeral entity rules. All three of the ephemeral entities can end up fusing themselves with mortals resulting in claimed. There are ghost-claimed, spirit-claimed, and angel-claimed.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Never saw angel claimed","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T07:05:48-08:00","id":1057580,"title":"","content":"Goetics can claim as well, although they might need Mage help getting that manifestation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T07:26:17-08:00","id":1057586,"title":"","content":"Claim is a generic Manifestation meaning any entity that can have Manifestations theoretically could have Claim. It's just that Claim is best described in Werewolf (which is the only book that actually lists Dread Powers for Claimed instead of just saying Claimed can have Dread Powers) and spirits (and Idigam, I guess) are the only ephemerals described in Werewolf.<br /> <br /> Edit: Only a few Manifestations are limited to certain ephemeral types. Reaching and Gauntlet Breach are spirit only, Avernian Gateway is for ghosts, angels and death-related spirits, and Shadow Gateway is for spirits and angels only. At least until a book describes a new type (or subtype) of ephemeral entity that also could use those Manifestations.<br /> <br /> Re-edit: The limits are certainly not set in stone. In Mage both Reaching and Gauntlet Breach can be used by either type while Gateway has been condensed to just apply to the entity's home realm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":11887,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","user":"Tessie","date":". 03-03-2017, 10:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T09:02:59-08:00","id":1057618,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/932595-will-there-be-anymore-books?p=1057586#post1057586\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Claim is a generic Manifestation meaning any entity that can have Manifestations theoretically could have Claim.</div> </div> </div> </div>On the other hand, it's been noted that angels regularly have Infrastructure that skips them past most of the Manifestation system, Geist 2e was still quite some time away from announcement when the 2e core mechanics were released, and there were a couple of ghosts in 1e with the capacity to Claim corpses. That it's on the generic list doesn't necessarily point to non-spiritual bearers being unremarkable.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> In Mage both Reaching and Gauntlet Breach can be used by either type while Gateway has been condensed to just apply to the entity's home realm. </div> </div> </div>Mage also notably doesn't include Claim on its list (1e's version of the power further limited its description to &quot;permanent possession&quot;) and Werewolf's treatment of spirit-Claimed includes the new being ceasing to evince Rank in most respects. On the one hand, wordcount is almost certainly a contributing factor to this, but on the other hand, it's pretty clear from Werewolf's treatment of the subject that the Claimed are something a lot more involved than less ingrained varieties of Ridden.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T08:53:49-08:00","id":1060114,"title":"","content":"As a point of interest, I turned in an outline for a book to go to WW for approval yesterday.<br /> <br /> Just thought I'd mention it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-08T09:30:14-08:00","id":1060132,"title":"","content":"Very awesome.","signature